                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p> Dulles and Mendès-France held a conversation concerning leadership problems in
                    Indochina on October 3, presumably following the signing ceremonies for the
                    Nine-Power Conference. Dulles’ memorandum of this conversation is printed in
                        <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v13p2/pg_2115">volume XIII, Part 2, page
                        2115</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
